---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const photoPath = `${base}/sergio_mulet.webp`;
const abarthPhotoPath = `${base}/abarth.webp`;
---

<BaseLayout title="About me | My Portfolio" lang="en">
  <section>
    <h2>Personal information</h2>
    <p>
      Software Engineer from the University of Oviedo (Uniovi) focused on
      building reliable, high-performance software. My core interests lie in
      system architecture, backend engineering, IoT, and mobile solutions.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm comfortable working across languages and technologies (Python, Java,
      Node.js, Kotlin, C#) and I enjoy tackling problems end-to-end, from design
      to deployment. I care about clean code, user impact and effective
      teamwork.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm looking for an opportunity to keep growing alongside experienced
      engineers, ideally in an environment where technology makes a real
      difference.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <h2>Contact & Socials</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        GitHub:
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SergioMulet"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/SergioMulet</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        LinkedIn:
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/sergio-mulet-alonso"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >https://linkedin.com/in/sergio-mulet-alonso</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        Email:
        <a href="mailto:sergiokma15@gmail.com">sergiokma15@gmail.com</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Phone:
        <a href="tel:+34684639102">+34 684 639 102</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <img src={photoPath} , alt="Sergio Mulet" />
  </section>

  <article>
    <h2>Beyond the software 🦂</h2>
    <p>
      Outside of work, I enjoy spending time with my family and friends, but my
      true passion—inspired by my father and a close friend—lies in the world of
      motorsports. Growing up as a Formula 1 fan taught me to appreciate the
      beauty of high-performance machines. This led me to the Abarth 595, a car
      that perfectly embodies the balance between a solid base and raw, refined
      power. Just like in software, I love simple things that are reliable,
      efficient, and provide a great user experience.
    </p>
    <img src={abarthPhotoPath} , alt="My Abarth 595 turismo" />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
